# A lacuna message interpolating an optional source field its condition does not establish.
-- source.cue --
a!: int
o?: int
-- target.cue --
b!: int
-- lens.cue --
input: _
result: {b: input.a}
lacunas: [{
	sourceFields: [{path: "a", value: input.a}]
	message: "o was \(input.o)"
	type:    "DroppedField"
}]
-- out --
not total
lacunas[0].message reads input.o, which may be absent: input.o is optional in the source schema; add input.o != _|_ to the lacuna's condition (rule source-absent) @ lens.cue:5:11
